%;text-align: center;height: 10px\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Application Begin : <strong>03/08/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Last Date for Apply :&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b> <strong>28/08/2026</strong></b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Complete Form Last Date : <strong>28/08/2026&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">SAV Class 6th Pre Exam Date : <strong>October 2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">SAV Class 6th Mains Exam Date : <strong>December 2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 10px;width: 47.8557%\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Application Fees</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">General / BC / EBC / EWS : <strong>200</strong><b>/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">SC / ST : <strong>50</strong><b>/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / Online Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 146px\">\n<td style=\"width: 94.0562%;height: 14px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">SAV Class 6th Online Form 2027 : <span style=\"color: #008000\">Age Limit as on 01/04/2027</span></span></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <strong>10 Years</strong>.</li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>12 Years.&nbsp;</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"height: 62px;width: 94.0562%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">SAV Class 6th Admissions Notification 2027 :</span> <span style=\"color: #008000\">Admission Details</span></b><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 27.2705%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"2\"><b>Class</b></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 18.9299%;height: 25px\"><strong><b>Total Seat</b></strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 47.8557%\" colspan=\"2\"><b>SAV Class 6th Eligibility 2027</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 85px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 10px\" colspan=\"2\">SAV 6th Admissions Boys</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 18.9299%;height: 10px\">60</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 10px\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Passed the class 5th exam.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Spent/Studied full academic session in class III, IV and V</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 27.2705%\" colspan=\"2\">SAV 6th Admissions Girls</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 18.9299%\">60</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 206px\">\n<td style=\"width: 94.0562%;height: 111px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">SAV Class 6th Admission 2027 :</span> Document Required</span></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Apaar ID is Required for All Candidates.</li>\n<li>Passport Size Photo with Plain Light or Light Green Background.</li>\n<li>Aadhaar details/ Residence certificate Required.</li>\n<li>All types of certificates related to admission must also be uploaded.</li>\n<li>Example : Central Cast / Category / EWS / PH / ETC.</li>\n<li>Any Other Supporting Document Related to Admission.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"height: 25px;width: 94.0562%\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>SAV Class 6th Online Form 2026 are Released the Admission Notification Candidate Can Apply From <b>03/08/2026 to 28/08/2026</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Admission Section of Sarkari Result to Find Application Form in NVS Class 6th Admissions Online Form 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related 